
###
@('http://localhost:3000/funcionario)

### Cadastrar Funcionário
POST http://localhost:3000/funcionario
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Carlos Silva",
    "email": "carlos@logistica.com",
    "senha": "123"
}
### Cadastrar Motorista
POST http://localhost:3000/motorista
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Carlos Silva",
    "cnh": "111",
    "cpf": "12345678912",
    "telefone": "11999999999"
}

### Cadastrar Carga 
POST http://localhost:3000/carga
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "descricao": "Caixas de eletrônicos",
    "peso": 850.5,
    "volume": 12.3,
    "codRastreio": 100001,
    "idMotorista": 1
}

### Apagar Motorista
DELETE http://localhost:3000/motorista/4
Content-Type: application/json

### Consultar Motorista
GET http://localhost:3000/motorista/2
Content-Type: application/json

### Listar Motorista
GET http://localhost:3000/motoristas
Content-Type: application/json